        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Woody Rock\n- Music groups: Dru Hill\n- Places: Baltimore, Maryland\n- Topics: Nicknames, chart hits\n\nFacts:\n- Dru Hill was founded in Baltimore, Maryland, and has been active since 1992.\n- Dru Hill recorded seven Top 40 hits.\n- Dru Hill is best known for the R&B number-one hits \"In My Bed,\" \"Never Make a Promise,\" and \"How Deep Is Your Love.\"\n- Woody Rock's nickname came from his father saying he resembled the Woody Woodpecker cartoon character.",
